# held/weapons/spear: the spear (art weapon 8, `held spear.spear`; `held spear` until the resolver switches), P2c
# SLICE-ARMS 2026-10-23. STYLE_P2 11 / 25.7: a 34 px ash haft (2 px of wood: the lit line step 3, the shade step 2, no
# outline), a brass socket and a 5 px steel leaf with a white tip; 39 px in all. Origin = the RIGHT fist's grip, 9 px from
# the butt (the rear hand of the levelled guard and the thrust; the hand of the upright carry); the left fist takes the
# haft 6-8 px in front of it (its gripL on the haft line). a000..a337: degrees counter-clockwise from screen-right, drawn
# once for every facing. `carry` stands it upright (the butt a pixel off the ground at the resting hand), `carryR` /
# `carryL` lean it one step forward for the run, `drop` lays it level by a corpse's hand. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role held spear
role held spear.spear
layer held
anchor grip
keys held
tags anyfacing

